&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in Computer Science/Software Engineering or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 + years of experience with Backend Engineering in a high-level programming language (e.g., Java, C#, Golang).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, GCP, Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with microservices based architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases and message queue technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with continuous integration and deployment (CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity or experience with Golang, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Neptune, Docker, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our expanding R&amp;amp;D team and help drive the growth of Wiz. In this role, you&#39;ll be responsible for developing and maintaining large-scale distributed components that power Wiz. We&#39;re looking for candidates who are passionate about tackling scaling challenges and take pride in writing clean, efficient, and maintainable code. Join us in our mission to secure the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our tech stack includes a multi-cloud architecture (Azure, AWS, GCP, OCI, Alibaba Cloud) with Golang, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Neptune, Docker, Kubernetes, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end development of backend software components (research, design, development, testing, rollout, monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to technological and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting design and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing and improving efficiency, scalability, and stability of various backend system components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with cross-functional teams (e.g., Frontend, DevOps) to deliver top-tier features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title: &lt;/strong&gt;Director of Product &amp;amp; Tech Delivery&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristol or London (hybrid)&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £130,400 - £163,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in either Bristol or London and requires an existing right to work in the UK.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations, you’ll own the timely, predictable execution of our Product &amp;amp; Technology roadmap, for Kaluza and for our clients, across our global product, field deployment, and platform foundations teams. You’ll line-manage Heads and Group Delivery Managers, set the standard for how delivery is done across the function, and provide the leadership confidence around what we can deliver, both near-term and further ahead. You’ll move fluently between board-level narrative and the detail of a single stuck dependency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role spans four focus areas:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run delivery at scale &lt;/strong&gt;- own predictable, end-to-end execution across your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementing an AI-native system of wor&lt;/strong&gt;k - make AI-assisted delivery the default and raise the bar on how delivery is done, partnering with our P&amp;amp;T business operations team to implement best practices across our product development lifecycle (PDLC) that are designed and standardised by the Business Operations team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow an independent, high-performing delivery community&lt;/strong&gt; - build a function that solves its own problems, and has a “yes if” attitude to solving the inevitable challenges of the day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner and Influence at the Executive Level&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run delivery at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and drive successful delivery across Kaluza’s Product and Tech organisation, typically multiple streams that may align to client programmes or global initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end delivery of the Product &amp;amp; Tech roadmap across your area, e.g. across multiple client streams (OVO &amp;amp; ENGIE in Europe, AGL &amp;amp; Shell in APAC) or multiple global product streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement evolutions of a standard methodology that allows the business to scale and ensures successful client implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive absolute roadmap alignment, delivery enablement and reporting at multiple levels, from team detail to executive overview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring confidence to what we can deliver, near-term and further ahead through robust capacity planning, milestone tracking (actuals vs estimates), forecasting, and proactive management and resolution of cross-team dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, UX and Client Delivery leadership so deliverables meet client capabilities, support needs and timelines, and so client feedback flows back into the delivery process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide objective, data-led neutral insight on how delivery is really going; proactively escalate risks and issues early, and drive decisions with senior leadership and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed good practices into our internal delivery management practices that are developed by the Business Operations team, and provide input to shape their future roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deputise for the VP when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement an AI-native system of work through delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the strategic evolution of our delivery practices by embedding AI-assisted methodologies into default operational workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed AI-assisted delivery into reporting, forecasting, capacity and effort analysis, dependency mapping, risk detection and status communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push the boundaries of Jira, JQL and agentic workflows; build dashboards and reporting that drive development forward at pace and replace manual effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify and standardise practice across Product &amp;amp; Tech: refine ways of working, embed Agile &amp;amp; Lean practice, and raise predictability and the effort-to-value ratio in your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a change driver, co-own the delivery of a roadmap of improvements to our system of work alongside Business Operations, and bring people with you through the change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion continuous improvement and show the function what good, AI-native delivery looks like in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow an independent, high-performing delivery community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build a self-sufficient, empowered function that is a gold standard for getting things done, effectively, and with transparency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a group of people leaders and delivery managers, Heads of, Group and Lead) Delivery Managers, setting clear objectives, focus and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the team to navigate complexity and uncertainty, to self-solve, and to bias their effort towards Kaluza’s goals and our client commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know the product and coach the team to understand the product domain for their area so that they can enable cross-functional team delivery of the product roadmap and client delivery goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and upskill across the community; show the team what good looks like and raise the standard across the board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear the barriers that stop Product teams focusing on innovation and strategy, and Engineering teams focusing on technical excellence and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Delivery function in achieving its strategy and goals, and champion the wider change and planning agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an innovative thinker and member of the larger Kaluza SLT team to drive the business forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner and Influence at the Executive Level&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted partner to Product, Engineering, UX, and Client Delivery leadership, serving as an active member of the Senior Leadership Team (SLT)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently manage relationships with C-level clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver objective tracking, milestone visibility + forecasting, and proactive risk mitigation strategies to leadership, while serving as a strategic deputy for the VP of Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re an accomplished delivery leader with a strong track record. Ideally, you’ll be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; an executor: you define what good looks like, take full accountability, and go looking for what you need rather than waiting for a brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely AI-native: AI tools feel like leverage, not an afterthought. You have deep curiosity in innovation and AI tools, actively pushing AI adoption into delivery practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steady in ambiguity: A nimble leader who thrives in complex undefined spaces, is comfortable diving into problems at multiple altitudes, and the steady presence others rely on when the path isn’t fully defined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Delivery Leader: An accomplished delivery leader and a bar raiser when it comes to of managing large-scale, cross-functional delivery management functions within a high-growth SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced leading delivery management at scale: line-managing and developing people leaders, across cross-functional Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams using agile methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to design and evolve delivery operating models, governance and ways of working, with an openness to follow current Kaluza practice and refine where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A trusted partner: to Product &amp;amp; Engineering leadership, able to influence senior leadership,and credible with C-level clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong listener, people leader &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; coach: able to empower teams and colleagues to reach their full potential, and to bring people along on a change journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent with Jira, or similar roadmapping tools, with real curiosity about using JQL and AI to generate dashboards and reporting that drive development at pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable switching between team-level detail and executive-level overview, applying the right approach in the right context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to radical candour: you ask hard questions, and give honest developmental feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience managing delivery frameworks across major global energy utility accounts or multi-regional client programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven background or curiosity in implementing an AI-integrated Product Development Lifecycle alongside business operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with a requirement of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday + bank holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including up to 26 weeks full pay for primary caregivers and 4 weeks full pay for secondary caregivers when welcoming a new addition to your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life. Our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in &lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we build simple, affordable financial tools that empower over 4 million small businesses worldwide to get paid, manage their money, and thrive. We are a global team of 3,000+ people across 20+ offices and 90+ nationalities, all dedicated to supporting merchants with excellent products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Talent Acquisition team, we don&#39;t just fill seats. We care deeply about hiring excellence and finding people who truly elevate our teams. For us, recruitment is a team sport - we win together, constantly looking at how we can improve and bounce ideas off each other, and always step in to help whenever someone gets stuck or hits a wall.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our&lt;strong&gt; Consumer Mission &lt;/strong&gt;- building the &lt;a href=&quot;https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.sumup.pay&amp;amp;hl=en&quot;&gt;SumUp App&lt;/a&gt; - is scaling fast and we’re looking for a Senior Tech TA Partner to help the team navigate London’s hyper-competitive market, where top engineers are in high demand.Your superpower will be understanding how to position SumUp&#39;s massive scale and impact to passive talent. Operating as a true talent advisor, you will own hiring across Engineering, Product, Data, and Design (EP&amp;amp;D) for the Consumer portfolio, scaling the technical teams responsible for turning SumUp into a leading financial services platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full-cycle hiring journey for complex roles across Engineering, Product, Design, Data and some commerical role for the Consumer tribe, maintaining a consistently high talent bar as we scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted, embedded relationships with Consumer leadership. You’ll serve as a proactive advisor rather than a reactive coordinator - running regular hiring cadences, maintaining pipeline visibility, and providing market-led recommendations on role prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at identifying, engaging, and closing high-caliber passive tech talent in the London market, knowing how to articulate our technical challenges and unique value proposition effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyze funnel health metrics across your portfolio to surface blockers, challenge hiring assumptions, optimize sourcing efforts, and provide stakeholders with clear, honest pipeline updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an inclusive hiring process that guarantees an exceptional experience for candidates and hiring teams alike, ensuring we stand out in a crowded market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of managing full-cycle talent acquisition for Engineering, Product, Data, and Design and Commercial roles within fast-moving tech or fintech environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a deep understanding of the London and broader UK tech landscape, with a knack for mapping talent pools and knowing what it takes to attract and win over high-demand, engineering talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate as a trusted business partner rather than just executing briefs - confidently managing multi-stakeholder portfolios, advising hiring managers on market realities, and expertly guiding interview calibration and debriefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a data-first mindset, using funnel analytics and recruiting metrics to identify what’s working, track pipeline efficiency, and clearly influence stakeholder decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a genuine care for candidate experience, bringing empathy and transparency to every stage of the hiring journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note: We are unable to offer visa sponsorship for this role. You must have the right to work in the UK to be considered.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our central Covent Garden location, wrapped in historic charm and modern flair. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
