&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering and design to drive execution of product initiatives — from scoping and requirements through launch and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to product discovery and prioritization, helping assess opportunities and shape the roadmap alongside your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships across engineering, design, data, operations, and other stakeholders to drive alignment and remove blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track product performance and use data to identify what&#39;s working, what isn&#39;t, and what to do about it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop expertise in the payments domain and stay curious about how our product, customers, and competitive landscape evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
